  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 425°F (220°C).",
    "Toss the red bell peppers with olive oil, garam masala, cumin, coriander, paprika, salt, and black pepper in a large bowl until they are evenly coated.",
    "Spread the peppers out in a single layer on a baking sheet lined with parchment paper.",
    "Roast the peppers in the preheated oven for 30 minutes, turning occasionally, until they are tender and slightly charred.",
    "Remove the peppers from the oven and let them cool slightly.",
    "Cut the peppers open and remove the seeds and membranes.",
    "Add the rosemary sprigs to the peppers and serve immediately."
